&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 id=&#34;amnezia-vpn&#34;&gt;Amnezia VPN
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h3 id=&#34;the-best-client-for-self-hosted-vpn&#34;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The best client for self-hosted VPN&lt;/em&gt;
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/amnezia-vpn/amnezia-client/actions/workflows/deploy.yml?query=branch:dev&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
